      "en": "Jesus said to him, “I am the way, the truth, and the life. No one comes to the Father, except through me.",
      "ko": "예수께서 가라사대 내가 곧 길이요 진리요 생명이니 나로 말미암지 않고는 아버지께로 올 자가 없느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "d5b1db2cafed05f03e9dcc8969eef8a7e89a2fb88082c3c23652b6d58019209c",
      "translation_text_hash": "2a7bcb6607b183a9f74ddea1c7d9f33612c677c083e96643bcfc746dfb2a7032",
