      "en": "If you had known me, you would have known my Father also. From now on, you know him and have seen him.”",
      "ko": "너희가 나를 알았더면 내 아버지도 알았으리로다 이제부터는 너희가 그를 알았고 또 보았느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "bba624ffe000469eeed7b6209a077095607dee86369a519e1c76c5c043b5b405",
      "translation_text_hash": "7e71a6362134f6453af152ba2292cecb0892d1b7d00df26f512e8db8dbdbc970",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
