      ],
      "en": "Jesus said to him, “Have I been with you such a long time, and do you not know me, Philip? He who has seen me has seen the Father. How do you say, ‘Show us the Father’?",
      "ko": "예수께서 가라사대 빌립아 내가 이렇게 오래 너희와 함께 있으되 네가 나를 알지 못하느냐 나를 본 자는 아버지를 보았거늘 어찌하여 아버지를 보이라 하느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "e68a2c6cf4b6b6a72d6d953407fb900c77f83362fe4953043634cecd60cad6f3",
      "translation_text_hash": "73ae57b68f5fd4100f8a937036be008f8231466e3a6b54d0aeaab99b57e84e46",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
