      "en": "In that day you will know that I am in my Father, and you in me, and I in you.",
      "ko": "그 날에는 내가 아버지 안에, 너희가 내 안에, 내가 너희 안에 있는 것을 너희가 알리라",
      "source_text_hash": "10e7bfca9cd5dfd8219d0a8ab4c88aa663dbfeb23ebef43ba1180847982cf061",
      "translation_text_hash": "d4ec910b4ebd0951b3eb8bfcc3c1cae2cd46aae0134a2a6d8f24f637a92b1ad0",
