      "en": "Judas (not Iscariot) said to him, “Lord, what has happened that you are about to reveal yourself to us, and not to the world?”",
      "ko": "가룟인 아닌 유다가 가로되 주여 어찌하여 자기를 우리에게는 나타내시고 세상에게는 아니하려 하시나이까",
      "source_text_hash": "cd2b2a3c7b81bfdfbc44f82e253bcef4476375105899dbabaff2efa6cc33f96f",
      "translation_text_hash": "09bff77eebc86f7e68783ea1fdcd68042117c84355841ade86c61bc18b014ebf",
